  <name>Lemonade</name>
  <summary>Local AI server with GPU and NPU acceleration</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Lemonade is a local AI server that provides the same capabilities as cloud APIs,
      but 100% free and private. Run the latest models for chat, coding, speech, and
      image generation on your own NPU and GPU.
    </p>
    <p>
      Features include:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Multi-modal AI support: chat, speech transcription, text-to-speech, and image generation</li>
      <li>GPU and NPU acceleration for optimal performance</li>
      <li>OpenAI, Anthropic, and Ollama compatible APIs</li>
      <li>Model management with automatic download and optimization</li>
      <li>Privacy-focused: all processing happens locally</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
